I walk on to a new aisle.
I look at the food.
The supermarket has many things from other countries.
I look for a taste of Mexico.
I miss the food from home.
I really like beans.
I often eat black beans.
I look at a low shelf.
The shelf is a bit dark.
But I see a colourful can.
The can stands all the way at the back.
It is a can of black beans.
I smile.
I reach my arm all the way in.
I pull the can out.
I look closely at the can.
It is perfect for my dinner.
I put the can in the basket.
I have enough food.
